    "text": "……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010004050300,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "この間の目標の話です",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000405/1010004050300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010004050310,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私は、私を見て、私の歌を聴いて、\r\n私を思ってくれている間を──",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000405/1010004050310"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010004050320,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "みんなの特別な時間にできるような、\r\nそんなアイドルになりたい",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000405/1010004050320"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010004050330,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私を推して、後悔させないだけじゃない……\r\nずっと夢中にさせるような",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000405/1010004050330"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010004050340,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "応援してもらっている分を、いつだってそれ以上で\r\n返せるような──そんなアイドルになります",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000405/1010004050340"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それじゃあ、叶えなくちゃな\r\n智代子なら絶対、なれるから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010004050350,
